summary.label:
Learn to speak Chinese New Year greetings, lucky phrases, with ease on your iPhone.

There are many ways (different Chinese characters) to express a given English phrase.  If you are interested in expanding your Chinese vocabulary and/or want to impress others with your Chinese speaking abilities, then this app is for you.  

There are 138 popular lucky phrases in this app.  These phrases are related to Chinese New Year, Rat Year, luck and fortune, peace and seasons, health, the elderly, family, students/kids, love, business, career, money, success, beauty, and numbers.  Each written greeting has an English version and a Chinese version.  The Chinese version contains a scroll with four Chinese characters.  The app speaks Mandarin and Cantonese.   

As a bonus, one of the features of this app is the QR Code.  Like a seal, a stamped block that consists of an artist's signature on a Chinese scroll, a QR Code, a square shape can contain a person's name or more.  You can be creative and compose a genuine message and convert it into a QR Code, which anyone can scan to reveal the message if the person has a QR code reader. Just click on the share button, and share your message to the world - love ones, acquaintances, and friends.

Key Features of the app:
- Includes 138 popular lucky phrases for Chinese New Year;
- Speaks Mandarin and Cantonese;
- Each written greeting has an English version and a Chinese version;
- You can compose a genuine message and convert it into a QR Code, which anyone can scan to reveal the message if the person has a QR Code reader;
- You can send the image of the Chinese scroll with the QR Code to people - loved ones, acquaintances, and friends by clicking on the share button.
